# UI

- Whimsical light-first (+ soft dark); **Grandstander** + **Lexend**; Sage Garden tokens from `packages/ui` theme (cream / sage / potato gold — **never** purple/indigo clones).
- **Token roles** (`packages/ui/src/theme.css` + `tailwind-preset`):
  - **primary** = sage — main actions, path, board chrome
  - **secondary** = potato gold — warm brand accent (score badge, selected mode cards, secondary buttons, hard challenge)
  - **accent** = soft sage — hover/soft wash only (not a second brand)
  - **muted** = soft sage-gray — chip/segment tracks, ghost hover
  - Prefer `bg-secondary` / `text-secondary` / `text-secondary-foreground`; `--potato` is an alias of secondary (legacy)
- **UI inspiration (steal craft, keep brand):**
  - [TypeUI](https://www.typeui.sh/) thinking: design-system tokens first, then hierarchy / spacing rhythm / type leading / interaction feedback as the reasoning layer. Steep display→label contrast; motion for entrance, feedback, transition only; depth via luminance + surface — not flat robot UI.
  - Tactile word-game refs (user CleanShot set): pillow cream tiles, thick rounded board frame, circular select (square) / hex tile tint + drop-shadow ring (B-comb) + juicy path stroke, word pill + score badge, atmospheric background. No Scrabble TW/TL multipliers. Hex select is the clipped tile itself (`HEX_CLIP`) so `--cp-tile-gap` gutters cannot offset a separate overlay; path SVG shares `.cp-board-play` with the tile grid.
- **Motion:** any meaningful interactivity should show the change — short CSS/NativeWind transitions/feedback (segment pill slide, select pop, Target↔Timed swap, button press, path/score ticks, screen enter). Keep whimsical, light, performant. Prefer CSS; don’t animate everything mindlessly; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. No anime.js unless CSS can’t cover it.
- **Web chrome:** shadcn/ui (Radix + Tailwind) is the preferred base for Button/input/dialog/toast — customize (toy press shadows), don’t hand-roll duplicates. Game board (`LetterGrid`, path, tile drop, confetti) stays custom + tactile. Board cast shadow lives on non-rotating `.cp-board-frame`; only `.cp-board-spin` rotates (see `AGENTS.md` Rotate).
- **Copy / voice:** prefer **gaming terminology** (Play, lobby, run, haul, SFX, spin, Couch crew) over sterile app/form words (Submit, Settings, Confirm). Whimsical Couch Potato — clear for casual players, not esports jargon. Icon tooltips/`aria-label` match that voice.
- **Icons over text** when the glyph is faster (sound, pause, rotate, couch crew, share): `lucide-react` + `aria-label` + shadcn `IconTooltip` (hover/focus; Radix long-press on touch — don’t rely on tooltip alone). Drop native `title` when Tooltip is present (double chrome). Keep lobby mode/challenge labeled; mid-run **End run** lives in the Escape/pause menu (soft confirm).
- **Web cursors:** lean global rule in `apps/web/src/index.css` (`button`, `[role=button]`, `a[href]`, `summary`, labels/inputs) — don’t sprinkle `cursor-pointer` per class. Letter board: `grab` / `grabbing` while swiping. Tile hit acceptance uses `--cp-tile-gap` gutters + `isInTileHitZone` edge inset (dead zone between letters). Path backtrack (revisit → pop/truncate) only in the tile **center zone** (`isInBacktrackZone` / `allowBacktrack`) so diagonal transit that clips a previous corner does not false-pop.
- `packages/ui` RN Button = Expo/RN path; web app chrome → shadcn. Don’t maintain two competing web Buttons.
- Mobile-first; minimize one-off Tailwind in routes.
- **Home lobby IA:** toy cards/tiles (`HomeSetup`) — not stacked MODE/GRID label+segment rows. Hierarchy: mode cards → board picker → challenge → collapsed word length → Scout (words-left HUD) → dominant Play.
- **Play HUD IA:** one top row — primary status (`N pts` remaining for target, or timer for timed) + compact icon cluster (mute / pause only); scout count as muted “N left” readout when on (toggle lives in Couch break + lobby Scout — not HUD); no stacked haul/score pills (per-word pts live on the word-bubble badge); progress under the row for target; spin stays by the board.
- **Container queries = web-only.** Cross-platform layout: flex + max-width. No `@container` in pure RN views.
- **Viewport shells:** root `h-dvh overflow-hidden` → `Shell` fills height (`flex flex-col min-h-0`). Scroll inside a child (`flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto`), not body alone — lobby keeps Play+mute as a shrink-0 footer outside that scroller.
- UI changes require interactive verify (pointer swipe for play) — see `.cursor/skills/verify-ui`.
